## Implementation order

1. The dependencies of § 7, if any — nothing below compiles without them
2. `OrderConfirmedPayload` (producer side) + `OrderConfirmedPublisher`
3. `OrderConfirmedPayload` (consumer side) + `OrderConfirmedListener`
4. `ProcessedEventStore` port + adapter (or reuse, if `persistence-architect` already built one)
5. Properties in `application.yml`
6. `DefaultErrorHandler` + `DeadLetterPublishingRecoverer` bean, once per consumer group
7. Integration test against a real broker (Testcontainers) — `40-testes.md`
